          "author": "Yoto",
          "description": "Pull up a chair and tuck in! Country Cookin' serves up ten foot-tappin', finger-lickin' songs about everything kids love on the dinner table:  from gooey “Mac N Cheese”and “Chocolate Chip Cookies” to a “Summer Sunday BBQ”. Along the way, little listeners learn a few helpful tricks too, like how to “Set The Table”, why a Cowboy always cleans his plate, and the trouble with that pesky Napkin. Country twang, big grins and crumbs on the chin guaranteed.\n\n\nCooked up in Nashville and Florida by a seasoned crew of country-loving musicians, these songs use the same studios, sounds and skills that have launched many legendary country hits.\n\nThis is the kind of music  that makes even a rainy afternoon feel like Sunday supper. Pull up a chair, the food and music is ready.\n\nDiscover: 2 tracks. \nAvailable until 31st July. \nFull Card: 10 tracks. For ages 0-12",
